WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.270
'The heart donor baby
in the twins has pneumonia.'

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.590
'The lungs are fully inflamed.
Do something, Arjun.'

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:08.030
'Don't waste your time, Arjun.
I will not  come back.'

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.690
'Don't think that
I'll change my mind'

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.450
'just because you're
not going to the hospital.'

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.110
'Whatever you do or don't do'

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.390
'you're my mother.'

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.610
'But in RK hospital'

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.350
'you are Dr. Radhi
only if you help others.'

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.430
'Good job, guys.'

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:24.570
'Thank you, ma'am.'

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.150
'Friends?'

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.260
'Arjun.'

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:31.590
'Reena.'

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.640
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.840
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.290
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.470
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.980
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:11.690
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.360
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.630
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.660
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.190
♪ In it, I am also a doctor ♪

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:01.380
In this heat, it's difficult
to go to outdoor medical camps.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.300
I can't bear it.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:04.540
My skin is tanned.
It's burning.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.050
I've attended a lot of camps.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:09.360
It's enough if you keep
your skin hydrated

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.560
and sun-protected
throughout the day.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:12.970
You can work without any worries.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:19.690
This is Ponds Skin Institute's
Sun Miracle Sunscreen.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.960
It contains SPF 50+.
It also contains niacinamide.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:27.350
This will prevent sun damage
and lighten dark spots.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.580
Oh.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.090
This alone is enough. It will keep
your skin hydrated and protected.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:34.800
Is one product enough?
- Yes, it's enough.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.070
Tell our guys too.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.540
They've been in the sun
for a long time.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:38.670
This will be useful for them.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.920
Thanks, senior.
I'll tell them.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:43.460
Hey!
- I forgot to give you the file.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.290
Hey, Reena.

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:53.370
Hi.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.130
Then?
- Then what?

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.880
Yesterday, I saw you
and Arjun in the parking lot.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.170
You guys were shaking hands.

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:09.110
What do you mean?

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.330
I think you guys got together.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.080
What do you mean?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.110
Oh. Is that how you're going to be?

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:18.920
You don't have to say anything.
- Hey, hey...

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:20.390
Then what?

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.590
If we were shaking hands,
does that mean we got together?

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:25.390
We are just friends.
- Oh. Just friends.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.790
We both work at the same hospital.
How can we avoid facing each other?

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.460
It will affect our work.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.620
That's why.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.060
Then, what happened to Dr. Radhi?

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.670
What happened to Dr. Radhi?

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.170
She's in the hospital.

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.680
What hospital?

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:46.280
I got it...
- What did you get?

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.700
Reena, if you don't want
to answer, say it directly.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:53.710
Don't irritate me,
repeating the same

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.100
I saw Dr. Radhi's car in the
parking lot. That's why I asked.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.350
If you ask me,
how would I know?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:03.780
Maybe, she's here
to join the hospital.

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:07.050
Maybe, she's here to meet Arjun.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.300
Where are you going?

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.200
To see Patient Ganga.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:15.790
I'll leave.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.360
Bye.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:23.140
Hello, sir.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:24.500
How are you?
- I'm fine...

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.220
How are you?
- I'm fine...

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.500
Sorry, sir.
I just came to know.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.800
I came straight here.
- Oh, I see.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:35.560
Hi, sir.
- Come in, ma'am.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:40.050
What is Ganga's update now?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.000
Ma'am, she already
has three stents.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:44.810
I know. Tell me.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.690
Yes, ma'am. In those stents,
there's a growth of thrombosis.

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:51.930
And we noticed a slight variation
with her heart.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:56.680
These are the TROP-INTO reports,
and it's positive.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.610
Since there are already
three vascular blocks

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.740
we need to be more careful.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.020
Yes, ma'am. That's why
we're observing closely

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:07.220
without proceeding further.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:09.020
Okay.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.130
Radhi, they said that you resigned.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.380
Are you back to join again?

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.420
Sir.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.160
did the nurse give you
the medicines

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:25.750
on time?
-Yes, they are giving it correctly.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.710
Okay, sir.
I'll be back in an hour.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:30.900
Okay, ma'am.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:32.480
Thank you, sir.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.590
No, sir.
They called me for a surgery.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.410
I need to think about joining.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:43.410
Why?

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:49.060
I'm thinking about whether
to join here or somewhere else.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.420
Another hospital?

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:52.580
Why?

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:54.460
Did anyone talk ill to you?

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:56.050
Is your salary low?

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.000
Tell me whatever it is.
I'll talk to them and solve it.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.710
No, no.
It's nothing like that, sir.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:01.630
Then what?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.800
Arjun is the CEO. Whatever he
gives as his best, it's not enough.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:08.320
He's too young for this position.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:14.500
In such a situation, I want you
to support him and guide him.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.370
If Mr. RK were to be here
he would've wanted the same thing.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.100
He would've asked you to do this.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:25.750
Even if I'm not here,
Arjun is doing well.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.730
Let's say Arjun is doing well.

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.910
Are you happy with your decision?

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:37.870
I think, hopefully,
you'll make a good decision.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.580
Hi, ma'am.
- Hi, Arjun.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.020
Please.
- Thank you.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.400
Thank you so much, ma'am.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:56.720
For making the surgery successful.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:58.670
For the sake of patient safety

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.780
you didn't care about
personal reasons and issues.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:03.870
That's so nice of you, ma'am.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:08.710
And you helped uphold the hospital's
reputation at the right time.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:12.750
And ma'am, in this hospital, your
position is always open for you.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.060
You can come anytime...
- Arjun.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.810
I don't have any problem
working here.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.550
But I have some conditions.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.430
Tell me, ma'am.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.550
I won't get involved in any
requirements from the management.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.160
And, I can only work
here as a consulting doctor.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:34.590
And I heard, Dr. Preetham, he's the
chief doctor now. Let him continue.

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:36.040
Don't change anything for me.

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.020
As you wish, ma'am.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.120
I don't have any objection.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.380
I'm happy that you're coming back.
- Arjun, I'm not done yet.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.860
And, I need an intern
to work with me.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:49.010
I'll choose the intern myself.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.030
Sure, ma'am.
There are three new interns.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.880
Not just them...
We have Naveen, Rocky..

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.540
And Reena.
- I don't want any of them.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:01.690
Who else, ma'am?

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.420
Should we appoint someone new?

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.080
No, the old one.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:06.740
The old one?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.920
Who?
- Teju.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.170
Teju?

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.380
Yes.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:20.520
Ma'am, after the CEO elections

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:23.250
the board members
and I terminated Teju.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.200
And she deserves it
after all she did.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.500
Arjun, I didn't justify
what Teju did.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.960
And, she is not here now.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.520
Consider her suspension period as
a punishment for deleting the log.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.430
She didn't do just that, ma'am.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.830
I don't think Teju
would've done that.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:45.880
With all due respect...

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.290
Just because you say so

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.390
doesn't mean that she didn't do it.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:55.980
Arjun, I'm not here to discuss
what Teju did or didn't do.

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:59.370
Teju is a skilled
and talented doctor.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.520
I can't accept her working
in a no-name clinic.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:04.410
Her growth is getting affected.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:09.180
Arjun, after all.
Teju will be working with me.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.430
I'll take care.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.450
Okay, ma'am.
- Thank you.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.130
Just because you requested.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.380
Yeah, thank you.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:27.280
Sir, the case of a dog bit..
Room 401, Catherine.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.630
I've submitted the value chart.

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.910
I need your permission to discharge
her after observing for two days.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.280
Sir, I've updated the files.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.850
If you sign it, I'll shift
the patient to the ward.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.380
Am I a good doctor?

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:46.920
Why are you asking like this, sir?

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:50.210
You are here as the chief doctor
because of your excellence.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.030
You're such a great doctor.

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.050
I think you don't understand
what I'm asking.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:55.930
Let me rephrase it.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.300
Am I a better doctor than Radhi?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.720
Sir, I've just joined the hospital.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.480
I've never worked with Dr. Radhi.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.670
That's why I don't know.
Ask me about you.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:08.680
I'll tell you correctly.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.120
But even if I don't know her...

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.840
I've heard a lot
from the people in this hospital.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.340
Dr. Radhi is a very good doctor.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:20.170
I've heard she has done many
good things for the hospital.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.060
Oh!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.680
You want to work
with her in the future.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.130
So you are speaking highly of her.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:27.870
Sir, what's this?
I said it because you asked.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.030
Is there no gratitude
in this hospital?

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.120
Everything I have done for them,
over the past two months...

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.120
I'm the one
who has been guiding them.

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.420
They forgot everything.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:39.070
When a new doctor comes,
they blindly trust her

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.420
and sing her praises.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:43.150
Including you.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:44.530
Sir..

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:46.380
Sir, Dr. Radhi is not new here.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.930
That's why they are affectionate.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.950
She looks beautiful it seems.
I've heard that.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.550
Get out...
- Sir...

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.650
Go and check on the patients.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:57.790
File..
- Idiot..

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.080
Thank you, sir.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.040
How did you get hurt?

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:11.930
Birthday bumps, bro.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:15.410
What are you saying, bro?
The bruises are so bad.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.910
They started hitting me
saying they're birthday bumps.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.120
Then it turned
into a big fight, bro.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:23.250
Hey!
- Sorry, sorry, sorry.

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.110
Do it gently.

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:25.490
It hurts.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.410
This is normal in college life.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.220
Without all this, there's no fun.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.210
Do you know how much
I've fought in my college life?

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.650
That's all fun, bro.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.440
Even after college

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.470
I still have a lot of adventures
and actions in my life every day.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:43.090
Bro, don't listen to him.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.000
A lot of people make up stories.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.460
Don't blindly believe everything.

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:49.410
They're not the same inside.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:52.090
Bro.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.120
Is she talking about you?

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:55.630
I know, shut up.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.290
You take rest. I'll ask
the nurse to administer a TT.

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:14.070
Nilofer.
- Tell me, Reena.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.510
If you don't believe him,
don't believe him.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.200
Why are you insulting him?

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.590
Reena, you don't know about him.

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:24.000
He builds suspense up like
a big rowdy and makes up stories.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.230
How do you know that's a lie?

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.430
Rocky told me.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.920
I believed him at first.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.530
But Rocky gave me clarity.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:37.000
So, you don't believe him.
But you believe what Rocky says.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:38.340
Okay.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.450
Do you believe what Kiran says?
- Yes.

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:44.300
Kiran and I went to the police
station to pay a fine for the bike.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:47.040
I hit the bike
behind me by accident.

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:48.610
That man came to fight me.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.780
At least,
that guy scolded me verbally.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.350
But, Kiran hit him hard.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.920
Oh, no, that guy must have gone
to bring his men.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:57.850
Yes.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.270
After that guy left...

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:02.350
You must have convinced Kiran
and got him back.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:03.980
How do you know?

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.420
He told me.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:06.980
He told me then.

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.330
But I didn't believe him.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:12.150
I really shouldn't have
listened to Rocky.

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:17.210
Reena, please take care
of things for me. I'll be back.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.440
What?
- Nothing. I'll come and do it.

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.040
I'll be back.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.290
What's your problem now?

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:34.540
Go and tell everyone
in the hospital that I'm a liar.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.740
Will that make you happy?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.610
Kiran, I'm sorry.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:40.100
I listened to Rocky and...

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.810
I thought you were lying.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:43.580
I'm sorry.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.450
Shall I get you some juice?

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.010
Kiran, I'm sorry.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:54.050
What is this?
You insult me in public.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.200
But, you apologise to me
in private.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.500
Shall I apologize to you
like in the movie, 'Mouna Ragam'?

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:04.370
No? I'm telling you, right?

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.560
He exaggerated more than you.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.630
He made me believe
that you're lying.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:09.810
That's why, I believed him.

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.250
From now on, tell me all
your stories. I'll listen to them.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.790
Rocky is the reason for all this.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.550
If I get a hold of him...

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.210
Why is my name coming up?

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:24.300
Kiran..
-Here I come.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:28.420
Good timing.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.530
Even after I told you about the
history and luck of this hospital

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:35.770
you are having fun with him.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.910
Rocky, don't talk to me.
I'm very angry with you.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:41.170
What did I do?

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:43.450
What, bro..

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:47.180
Is it the same old story
or a new one?

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:49.110
Oh, no!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:50.510
What's with that look!

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:55.500
Rocky, I think
he is going to hit you.

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:56.360
Hit me?

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.490
All his stories are true.
- True?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.780
I think he has hit a lot of people.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.410
Reena is also there
as an eyewitness.

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:14.040
Confirmed.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:15.410
Confirmed?

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.860
What a mess!
I'm stuck here.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.290
You might be talking
something personal.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:24.530
Why should I disturb you?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.420
I'll leave. Get lost.
- Hey!

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:31.550
Kiran, sorry.

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:41.140
Amaya..

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.060
What is it?

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:46.390
We took a lot of tests
for the patient in room number 502.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.720
It didn't show up in the billing.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.800
Can you please check that?

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.430
Okay, Doctor.

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:57.400
Doctor? Didn't I ask you
to call me by my name?

00:15:58.870 --> 00:15:59.770
Okay.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:03.660
Amaya?

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:08.540
I don't know how Dr. Preetham
reacts to what.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.710
Why? What did he do?

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:14.600
Yes. He smiles a lot. But,
he is also very short-tempered.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.240
He had a long face.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:17.840
But, he was funny.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.210
I don't know what mood
he is in and I'm getting stuck.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.630
Moreover, he doesn't like
Dr. Radhi being here.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.670
He is in beast mode.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:30.180
Did he say that?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.860
It's okay if he said that.
He is taking his anger out on me.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:36.900
If he gets angry,
he will make my work pressure high

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.420
and then he will find fault in it.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.140
I'm just asking.
Is he like this in everything?

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.400
How dare you tell me all this?

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:48.110
I'm working with Dr. Preetham.
- I know that.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:49.210
That's why I asked you.

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.960
What will you do
if I tell him all this?

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:55.390
I know that you won't tell.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.480
It's okay even if you tell him.
I'm speaking the truth, right?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.040
M-Moreover...

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:03.710
there is a reason for me
to tell you all this.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:08.270
I feel like you smile
only when I talk like this.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.250
There... That's what I mean.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.970
Okay, please check
the case of Room no. 502.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:20.430
I'll leave now.
- Okay.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:23.440
I'll leave now.

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:39.510
Teju, come in.
- Ma'am, what were you thinking?

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.650
Why did you ask them
to cancel my termination

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.240
so that you can
rejoin the hospital?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:46.650
Ma'am.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.930
Look, I can't go to the hospital
again and face them at work.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.970
It will be as if
I asked you for help.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.040
I don't need such help either.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:56.550
Teju, I didn't do it to help you.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:18:00.630
You have all the skills to become
a great doctor in the future.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:03.550
And this opportunity is not
for you. It's for your skills.

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:08.030
You won't get a second
chance like this at RK Hospital.

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.530
Think about how to utilize it.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.410
Did I ask you for a second chance?

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:17.420
You won't be able to shine
in the clinic where you work, Teju.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.460
You won't have a career growth.
- I'll take care of that.

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:23.500
If I come to that hospital again,
I'll get blamed for others' mistakes.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.470
I cannot compromise my self-respect
just to work in that place.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:29.080
I didn't ask you to compromise
your self-respect and work, Teju.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.660
There's a chance to prove your
skills and make your life better.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.410
It's up to you whether
to take it or not.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:38.570
I've decided.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.620
I don't want this.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:59.030
Radhi, you've joined the job again?

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:00.510
Yes.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:01.750
Super.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.820
I came here to solve a problem

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:06.970
and it's solved.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.220
Thank God.

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:12.540
Why didn't you tell me sooner
that you've joined the job again?

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:13.740
Why?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.040
Did I tell you when I quit my job?

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.080
Why should I tell you now?

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:20.280
You've done what you
wanted to do, right?

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.890
Now go back to your place.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.500
Bill the patient's pills...
- Okay, Doctor...

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:36.400
Hi, friend.

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:38.540
Hi, friend.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.120
You look very busy.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:43.890
How's your work?

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:45.150
It's going well.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.670
When is your shift getting over?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.480
In half an hour.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.060
Half an hour?

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.630
How will you go?
- By bike..

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.300
Okay...

00:19:58.540 --> 00:19:59.350
Darn!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.220
What?

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:05.840
I mean... I can't go by car.

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.800
There's a puncture.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.970
That's why I said darn.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:13.880
I don't know when they'll fix it.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:16.010
The repairmen will come tomorrow.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.190
I don't know
how to go home in the evening.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:24.190
Maybe you can drop me...

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.020
No, I can take a cab, right?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:28.880
A cab...

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:35.700
I'll go by cab.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.120
I've checked it, Nurse.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:52.970
Senior, I've been looking for you.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:56.110
Anitha.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.880
I shouldn't have been angry.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:00.480
I shouldn't have spoken like that.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:01.870
I'm sorry.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.800
Senior.
Anitha.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.340
Anitha.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.120
You've told everyone about Raghav.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.420
Except me.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:16.780
That's why I got upset.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.150
Hey, I'm sorry.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:24.080
Guna, let's break up.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.610
Don't blabber in anger.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:30.170
Breakup...

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:33.420
Why do you want to break up?

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.380
I'm talking to you.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.300
This won't work out between us.
Do you understand?

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:48.300
Hey, Anitha.
We just started dating.

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:51.210
It will take time
for everything to work out, right?

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:58.040
You don't want me
to ask you anything, right?

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:00.270
I shouldn't express my feelings.

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:04.750
Whatever you say,
I should be silent.

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:06.720
I don't understand.

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:09.590
Is everything in this
relationship only about you?

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:13.690
If a relationship has to work out

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:15.520
both of us should care
for each other.

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:18.120
I care for you.

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:21.270
But you care only about yourself.

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:25.420
If that's the case,
it will take time.

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:30.880
If this is how you feel, why
are you still in this relationship?

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:35.910
I knew this wouldn't work out.

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:37.780
But you're the one
who's holding me back.

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:42.000
You're the one who's flirting with
everyone and having fun, right?

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:43.620
Then why are you feeling this way?

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:45.650
You're right.

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:50.040
But did you see me flirting with
anyone after we started dating?

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:56.780
Do you need a reason to break up?

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:00.220
Is that why you're
portraying me wrongly?

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:02.380
I understand.
- Dr. Guna.

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:04.310
What?
- There's an emergency.

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:05.830
Is it that big of an emergency?

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:07.780
Your mother has been admitted.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:20.790
Mom.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:22.550
Ma'am.

00:23:24.910 --> 00:23:25.860
I told you, right?

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:28.380
If I die...

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.570
I'll die in your hospital...

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:32.790
On your lap.

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:38.880
I'm here now.

00:24:46.376 --> 00:24:49.586
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:24:51.416 --> 00:24:53.946
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:24:56.526 --> 00:24:59.416
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:25:01.196 --> 00:25:03.426
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:25:03.656 --> 00:25:06.106
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:25:06.226 --> 00:25:08.756
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:25:08.996 --> 00:25:11.486
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:25:14.016 --> 00:25:16.526
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:25:19.016 --> 00:25:21.586
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:25:23.586 --> 00:25:27.786
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:25:48.966 --> 00:25:52.706
Guna, your mom's
test results are here.

00:25:55.406 --> 00:25:56.416
We know her condition.

00:25:57.046 --> 00:25:59.376
But she is a little critical now.

00:26:08.796 --> 00:26:12.046
No matter what treatment we do,
it won't improve.

00:26:13.566 --> 00:26:16.586
At least we can discharge her...
- Why are you discharging her?

00:26:18.356 --> 00:26:19.836
Can't my mom be with me
for some time?

00:26:21.866 --> 00:26:23.586
What is your problem with her
being with me?

00:26:23.836 --> 00:26:26.086
Hey, I didn't mean it like that.

00:26:26.526 --> 00:26:28.446
She is already sick here.

00:26:28.586 --> 00:26:31.916
I thought it would be worse
if she was in the hospital.

00:26:32.896 --> 00:26:35.336
Look, my mom will be with me.

00:26:35.756 --> 00:26:36.836
I know what to do for her.

00:26:38.966 --> 00:26:40.416
Hey.. Guna.

00:27:14.476 --> 00:27:15.916
You said you will take
the medication properly.

00:27:16.006 --> 00:27:16.966
So I sent you home.

00:27:20.126 --> 00:27:21.516
Did you take
the regular treatment or not?

00:27:23.086 --> 00:27:24.756
Why would I lie to you?

00:27:27.586 --> 00:27:32.556
I told you that there is a chance
this treatment might cure me.

00:27:34.086 --> 00:27:35.356
But I didn't say it for sure.

00:27:37.886 --> 00:27:42.026
Maybe there is no
chance in my case.

00:27:49.476 --> 00:27:50.666
Don't cry, Guna.

00:27:53.506 --> 00:27:55.636
If you cry, I will
also start crying.

00:28:01.656 --> 00:28:04.496
Do you know what everyone will say?

00:28:06.836 --> 00:28:11.876
They will say that Jennifer
suffered a lot in her last days.

00:28:13.666 --> 00:28:19.206
But they will remember
my sad face and tears.

00:28:24.566 --> 00:28:30.266
But if I am happy
and jolly like I always am...

00:28:33.696 --> 00:28:34.706
Everyone will say that

00:28:35.596 --> 00:28:40.296
Jennifer lived happily
in her last days.

00:28:41.166 --> 00:28:43.516
And they will remember my smile.

00:28:46.956 --> 00:28:50.916
I want everyone
to remember my smile.

00:28:54.096 --> 00:28:55.006
Don't cry.

00:28:59.246 --> 00:29:00.066
Look here.

00:29:00.126 --> 00:29:02.406
When I am here with you

00:29:03.626 --> 00:29:05.876
we should have a lot
of fun together.

00:29:07.966 --> 00:29:09.966
We should do
a lot of things together.

00:29:11.126 --> 00:29:12.006
Okay?

00:29:23.176 --> 00:29:24.546
Where are you taking me?

00:29:27.466 --> 00:29:28.696
'Fourth floor.'

00:29:57.756 --> 00:29:58.586
Hi, ma'am.

00:29:59.356 --> 00:30:00.416
Welcome back, ma'am.

00:30:08.086 --> 00:30:08.936
Thank you.

00:30:10.526 --> 00:30:12.666
So, guys Dr. Radhi is back to work.

00:30:13.606 --> 00:30:16.316
She is going to work here
as a senior attending doctor.

00:30:18.766 --> 00:30:20.306
What are you saying, Arjun?
No, no, no.

00:30:20.966 --> 00:30:24.696
It's not right for me to be
the chief doctor when she is here.

00:30:26.206 --> 00:30:27.946
She is the favourite doctor
of all the staff.

00:30:29.206 --> 00:30:30.466
Let her be the chief doctor.

00:30:30.606 --> 00:30:32.756
Sir, this is her decision.

00:30:34.046 --> 00:30:34.986
Not only that.

00:30:35.336 --> 00:30:37.416
She has also said that she won't
get involved with the management.

00:30:37.526 --> 00:30:38.466
You don't understand, Arjun.

00:30:39.596 --> 00:30:43.466
No one will accept me as
the chief doctor when she is here.

00:30:44.966 --> 00:30:48.266
We don't know how the staff will
react as Dr. Preetham says, Arjun.

00:30:52.796 --> 00:30:55.206
Please, don't try
to convince me, Arjun.

00:30:56.376 --> 00:30:57.966
Just ask her to take the position.

00:30:59.126 --> 00:31:01.466
Dr. Radhi, please
take the position.

00:31:03.846 --> 00:31:06.776
You have been working as the chief
doctor for the past two months.

00:31:06.916 --> 00:31:10.336
And you are thinking about
the staff instead of the position.

00:31:10.896 --> 00:31:13.206
What other quality do you need
to be the chief doctor?

00:31:14.366 --> 00:31:19.006
And I have realised a lot
of things in the past two months.

00:31:19.536 --> 00:31:21.456
The first thing is how
much I like this job.

00:31:22.506 --> 00:31:23.946
Even if we like the job

00:31:24.216 --> 00:31:27.746
once we get into a position,
that position hides our eyes.

00:31:29.556 --> 00:31:31.686
But it makes us forget

00:31:31.736 --> 00:31:33.766
that our job gives us
the fulfilment and not the position.

00:31:34.836 --> 00:31:36.186
But still, ma'am...
- Sir.

00:31:37.116 --> 00:31:39.036
Sir, don't change anything
just because I am here.

00:31:39.236 --> 00:31:40.296
This is your position now.

00:31:40.576 --> 00:31:41.606
You continue.

00:31:50.196 --> 00:31:52.626
I have to respect your words.

00:31:53.666 --> 00:31:56.696
So, I will continue.

00:31:57.606 --> 00:31:58.426
Okay, sir.

00:32:10.146 --> 00:32:10.956
What are you doing here?

00:32:12.156 --> 00:32:13.876
Why would a person
come to the hospital?

00:32:14.226 --> 00:32:15.296
To buy brinjals?

00:32:15.636 --> 00:32:17.096
I was not feeling
well since morning.

00:32:17.166 --> 00:32:20.206
So, I came to check my blood
sugar and BP. Nothing else.

00:32:20.256 --> 00:32:21.076
Reena!

00:32:23.276 --> 00:32:26.166
She is here.
I will check with Reena.

00:32:31.756 --> 00:32:35.526
Ma'am, I am happy that you
have joined the hospital again.

00:32:35.766 --> 00:32:37.116
Thank you...
- Very nice...

00:32:38.206 --> 00:32:39.026
Sir!

00:32:42.856 --> 00:32:44.506
Ma'am! He is your father.

00:32:45.056 --> 00:32:46.016
She knows that.

00:32:46.496 --> 00:32:47.726
He is very cute.
Hi!

00:32:48.396 --> 00:32:49.216
Thank you.

00:32:55.916 --> 00:32:56.736
He is a cutie.
- Hey..

00:32:58.976 --> 00:32:59.966
What is your problem, sir?

00:33:00.166 --> 00:33:05.376
I have a slight doubt about
my blood sugar and BP.

00:33:05.506 --> 00:33:06.466
So, I came to check.

00:33:07.266 --> 00:33:09.546
I think he is
suffering from low IQ.

00:33:09.816 --> 00:33:11.916
He has come here so many times.
But, he doesn't know who you are.

00:33:12.696 --> 00:33:14.316
I'm glad if he doesn't know.
Don't jinx it.

00:33:15.616 --> 00:33:18.836
Why are you both
murmuring to each other?

00:33:18.926 --> 00:33:20.706
Nothing like that, sir.
It is about you.

00:33:20.756 --> 00:33:21.876
About me?

00:33:22.256 --> 00:33:25.376
I mean, I want
to check you completely.

00:33:26.186 --> 00:33:27.286
Very good, very good.

00:33:28.166 --> 00:33:31.436
But, Reena. I don't understand
what is happening in your family.

00:33:32.256 --> 00:33:34.156
Why is he murmuring again?

00:33:34.416 --> 00:33:36.766
Nothing like that, sir.
You come inside.

00:33:36.816 --> 00:33:37.626
Let's check.
- Okay.

00:33:39.046 --> 00:33:40.136
Sir, here.
- Here?

00:33:43.116 --> 00:33:45.466
Your BP and blood sugar are normal.

00:33:45.626 --> 00:33:46.676
You don't have any problem.

00:33:47.166 --> 00:33:48.166
I know that.

00:33:48.766 --> 00:33:51.096
I wanted to talk to you in private.
That's why I made this plan.

00:33:51.606 --> 00:33:53.516
My daughter has joined work again.

00:33:53.706 --> 00:33:56.096
Everyone in this hospital
would have found out by now.

00:33:56.166 --> 00:33:58.836
They had arranged a meeting
for this in the conference room.

00:33:58.956 --> 00:34:00.296
Is it?
Very nice.

00:34:00.886 --> 00:34:03.026
Look, we have to celebrate that.

00:34:03.236 --> 00:34:09.036
So, I want to give you and a few
hospital members a small treat.

00:34:09.236 --> 00:34:11.246
Who else do you know
in this hospital?

00:34:11.326 --> 00:34:12.176
No one.

00:34:12.356 --> 00:34:13.876
That's why I came to you.

00:34:14.186 --> 00:34:15.876
Call some of your friends.

00:34:16.756 --> 00:34:18.166
I-I don't want that, sir.

00:34:18.996 --> 00:34:20.546
It isn't easy.
- Why?

00:34:20.776 --> 00:34:23.256
I want to share my
happiness with everyone.

00:34:23.386 --> 00:34:24.906
Why can't I do that?
Please.

00:34:25.606 --> 00:34:26.956
Everyone has a lot of work, sir.

00:34:27.376 --> 00:34:29.426
I know that.

00:34:29.626 --> 00:34:32.806
They can celebrate
in between your work, right?

00:34:34.006 --> 00:34:36.256
They won't come
if there is no alcohol.

00:34:36.916 --> 00:34:40.966
Look, I am going to arrange
a good meal in a first-class hotel.

00:34:41.566 --> 00:34:43.876
It is enough
if they taste the food.

00:34:44.086 --> 00:34:46.026
They will forget that
there is no alcohol.

00:34:46.126 --> 00:34:47.166
Listen to me.

00:34:48.586 --> 00:34:49.876
Sir, I mean...

00:34:50.266 --> 00:34:53.256
If there is no alcohol, they
will create a big problem.

00:34:53.736 --> 00:34:55.046
Rocky will create a big problem.

00:34:55.226 --> 00:34:57.796
It is very difficult, sir.
- Listen to me.

00:34:58.506 --> 00:34:59.916
Try for my sake.

00:35:00.016 --> 00:35:01.376
Everything will be fine.

00:35:01.896 --> 00:35:02.966
Please try.

00:35:07.156 --> 00:35:08.256
Very good.

00:35:08.666 --> 00:35:10.166
No pressure, no sugar.

00:35:10.416 --> 00:35:11.276
See you.

00:35:34.426 --> 00:35:35.256
Teju.

00:35:36.076 --> 00:35:36.916
Teju.

00:35:38.006 --> 00:35:39.416
Mr. Arjun is calling you.

00:35:51.176 --> 00:35:52.046
To be honest...

00:35:54.856 --> 00:35:56.466
You are here because of Dr. Radhi.

00:35:58.146 --> 00:35:59.706
I have cancelled your termination.

00:36:00.806 --> 00:36:01.796
But I will be watching you.

00:36:03.066 --> 00:36:03.886
Arjun.

00:36:04.706 --> 00:36:05.856
I have told you many times.

00:36:07.106 --> 00:36:09.166
But you are blindly
believing what Guna told you.

00:36:10.466 --> 00:36:12.306
Guna doesn't know about me,
so it's okay.

00:36:13.146 --> 00:36:14.076
But you know, right?

00:36:14.976 --> 00:36:17.366
I was the one who helped you
when this hospital was in trouble.

00:36:17.946 --> 00:36:19.546
At least considering that...

00:36:19.786 --> 00:36:21.586
I believe that you would
have investigated my case.

00:36:22.516 --> 00:36:25.016
But you threw me
out of the hospital.

00:36:26.296 --> 00:36:27.546
You don't have
any gratitude, right?

00:36:27.796 --> 00:36:29.136
You keep saying
that you didn't do it.

00:36:29.626 --> 00:36:30.466
Then who did it?

00:36:30.976 --> 00:36:31.946
I don't know all that.

00:36:33.166 --> 00:36:35.296
You find that culprit or don't.

00:36:36.016 --> 00:36:36.856
It's your problem.

00:36:41.156 --> 00:36:42.766
If you want to continue
working in this hospital

00:36:43.846 --> 00:36:44.916
just focus on your work.

00:36:45.326 --> 00:36:46.706
Concentrate only on that.

00:36:48.016 --> 00:36:50.336
I don't want to continue
working in this hospital.

00:36:51.346 --> 00:36:52.466
But what you said is right.

00:36:53.696 --> 00:36:55.156
I'm here only for Dr. Radhi.

00:37:07.226 --> 00:37:08.046
Show me your leg.

00:37:11.026 --> 00:37:11.896
Oh no.

00:37:13.276 --> 00:37:14.116
It's nothing.

00:37:14.396 --> 00:37:15.286
It's normal.

00:37:15.626 --> 00:37:17.896
Kids fall down
when they are playing.

00:37:19.606 --> 00:37:20.416
Show me.

00:37:21.966 --> 00:37:22.796
Is there any pain here?

00:37:23.546 --> 00:37:24.396
No, Doctor.

00:37:26.696 --> 00:37:27.686
The painkillers are working.

00:37:28.246 --> 00:37:31.376
Doctor, can you give her
an injection to prevent sepsis?

00:37:36.046 --> 00:37:37.866
Did you say she is 6 years old?
- Yes, Doctor.

00:37:38.656 --> 00:37:40.516
She doesn't need any TT
till she's 7 years old.

00:37:40.666 --> 00:37:42.166
Just give her
the painkillers and antibiotics.

00:37:42.206 --> 00:37:43.976
Okay, Doctor.
- I will prescribe some pills.

00:37:44.096 --> 00:37:46.386
Follow them regularly.
That's enough.

00:38:08.016 --> 00:38:09.876
Come, let's go.
- Take the pills properly.

00:38:10.586 --> 00:38:11.466
Bye, Sarah.

00:38:11.656 --> 00:38:12.506
Bye.

00:38:14.126 --> 00:38:14.976
What's your problem?

00:38:16.226 --> 00:38:17.516
I don't have any problem.

00:38:17.706 --> 00:38:18.706
Your duty is not here.

00:38:20.156 --> 00:38:20.976
What's this, Kiran?

00:38:21.796 --> 00:38:24.936
I've already apologised to you.
Why are you still angry?

00:38:25.006 --> 00:38:27.696
Hey, I am not angry.
I am being casual.

00:38:29.136 --> 00:38:32.546
You don't sit like this without
reason. What's the matter?

00:38:32.756 --> 00:38:33.866
No reason.

00:38:34.006 --> 00:38:35.466
I have to go for rounds
in 10 minutes.

00:38:35.846 --> 00:38:36.706
Oh.

00:38:37.406 --> 00:38:38.216
Okay.

00:38:42.256 --> 00:38:43.906
Hey, Kiran.
Can I ask you something?

00:38:44.356 --> 00:38:45.236
What is it?

00:38:45.626 --> 00:38:49.726
Why do you always smile
when you talk to Reena?

00:38:50.306 --> 00:38:51.166
Nothing like that.

00:38:52.136 --> 00:38:53.116
I see it all the time.

00:38:53.376 --> 00:38:55.256
You always smile
when you talk to Reena.

00:38:55.466 --> 00:38:57.006
But when you talk to me,
you are always angry.

00:38:58.206 --> 00:38:59.966
I am assisting Reena, right?

00:39:00.146 --> 00:39:01.326
I have to talk to her a lot.

00:39:01.456 --> 00:39:03.466
So, if I keep smiling like this

00:39:03.606 --> 00:39:04.966
she will give me less
work pressure, right?

00:39:05.276 --> 00:39:06.106
That's why.

00:39:06.676 --> 00:39:08.256
Despite me saying, I see it clearly

00:39:08.416 --> 00:39:10.056
you are lying so
confidently, right?

00:39:11.326 --> 00:39:13.446
Just admit that you are lying.
Why are you hiding that?

00:39:14.156 --> 00:39:16.416
You like Reena, right?
From the beginning.

00:39:17.976 --> 00:39:18.816
Yes.

00:39:19.016 --> 00:39:19.816
I like her.

00:39:21.076 --> 00:39:22.176
When I talk to her

00:39:22.496 --> 00:39:25.586
I feel like I am being caressed
by a cold breeze.

00:39:25.916 --> 00:39:26.726
Yes, yes.

00:39:26.876 --> 00:39:28.996
When she talks to you,
she is always cold, right?

00:39:29.476 --> 00:39:30.326
Not like that.

00:39:31.856 --> 00:39:33.006
When I talk to her

00:39:33.436 --> 00:39:35.006
I get happiness from the inside.

00:39:36.076 --> 00:39:37.206
When I see you...

00:39:37.336 --> 00:39:39.846
She must be getting irritated.

00:39:40.586 --> 00:39:41.536
I meant her.

00:39:43.936 --> 00:39:45.146
But shall I tell you the truth?

00:39:45.676 --> 00:39:47.696
When she talks to you,
she is always angry.

00:39:47.866 --> 00:39:48.756
She is not like that with us.

00:39:50.336 --> 00:39:51.166
I don't know.

00:39:51.466 --> 00:39:52.866
But, this is how I feel.

00:39:54.336 --> 00:39:55.966
Sir, shall I ask
the next patient to come?

00:39:56.486 --> 00:39:57.356
Yes, ask them to come.

00:39:58.216 --> 00:40:00.086
Will you leave?
I have to see the patients.

00:40:00.316 --> 00:40:01.376
Don't chase me.
I am going.

00:40:03.346 --> 00:40:04.156
Go.

00:40:08.756 --> 00:40:09.576
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:40:13.486 --> 00:40:14.306
Ma'am.

00:40:15.596 --> 00:40:17.566
Why are you handling
Ganga's case, Anitha?

00:40:18.346 --> 00:40:20.456
Ma'am, initially I was
handling that case.

00:40:20.846 --> 00:40:24.496
But after that, Dr. Preetham
asked Reena to handle that case.

00:40:24.776 --> 00:40:25.876
He asked me to relieve.

00:40:27.966 --> 00:40:30.326
Does Reena know that
you were handling this case?

00:40:30.836 --> 00:40:31.836
Yes, she knows.

00:40:32.926 --> 00:40:33.756
Okay.

00:40:34.896 --> 00:40:36.616
When Dr. Preetham assigned her

00:40:36.756 --> 00:40:38.056
she could have told
this to him, right?

00:40:38.676 --> 00:40:39.796
Yes, but

00:40:39.916 --> 00:40:41.966
Reena is considering
that case as hers.

00:40:46.536 --> 00:40:49.226
There are many
complications in Ganga's case.

00:40:51.376 --> 00:40:55.546
Especially, we shouldn't play second
guesses with a patient's life.

00:40:55.666 --> 00:40:56.746
We can't do that.
- Yes, ma'am.

00:40:57.176 --> 00:40:59.746
You do one thing. You handle this
case. I will talk to Dr. Preetham.

00:41:02.856 --> 00:41:03.766
Sure, ma'am.

00:41:04.476 --> 00:41:05.376
Thank you...
- You can go...

00:41:30.796 --> 00:41:31.676
Guna.

00:41:34.146 --> 00:41:35.466
How is your mom now?

00:41:37.926 --> 00:41:41.646
She has passed
the stage of recovery.

00:41:44.866 --> 00:41:48.396
Anitha is suggesting
to discharge her.

00:41:49.026 --> 00:41:49.866
Hey, Guna.

00:41:50.296 --> 00:41:51.586
When will they discharge your mom?

00:41:52.046 --> 00:41:53.996
What if my mom is here?
- Hey..

00:41:54.116 --> 00:41:56.056
How can you ask me
to discharge her?

00:41:56.696 --> 00:41:57.706
My mom should be here.

00:41:58.256 --> 00:41:59.796
Hey.
- I won't let them discharge her.

00:42:00.286 --> 00:42:01.986
Rocky didn't mean it like that.
- Hey..

00:42:02.876 --> 00:42:03.716
Hey, Guna.

00:42:04.206 --> 00:42:05.066
I..

00:42:09.636 --> 00:42:12.296
Dude, I don't know what to do.

00:42:15.906 --> 00:42:18.496
My mom and I are not that close.

00:42:20.216 --> 00:42:22.006
We never shared a strong bond.

00:42:24.616 --> 00:42:25.446
But..

00:42:26.316 --> 00:42:28.006
When I came to know
that we can't save her

00:42:28.766 --> 00:42:30.706
I couldn't accept it, dude.

00:42:31.506 --> 00:42:33.586
I can't concentrate on anything.

00:42:34.366 --> 00:42:36.966
I used to be able to keep personal
and professional life separate.

00:42:38.046 --> 00:42:41.256
But I don't know
how to react in this case.

00:42:41.336 --> 00:42:42.766
We can understand your situation.

00:42:43.456 --> 00:42:45.376
No one can be
rational in this situation.

00:42:47.626 --> 00:42:51.326
My mom wants to be happy
for the few days that she is left.

00:42:54.196 --> 00:42:55.356
Can I do that?

00:42:56.296 --> 00:42:57.526
I don't know
how I am going to do that.

00:42:58.006 --> 00:42:59.206
I don't know, dude.

00:42:59.646 --> 00:43:01.436
Hey, you are talking too much.

00:43:02.146 --> 00:43:04.756
That patient, Kevin... Didn't we
go to the police station for him?

00:43:05.666 --> 00:43:06.806
We took care
of a patient like that.

00:43:07.236 --> 00:43:08.086
She is your mom.

00:43:08.916 --> 00:43:09.736
You are right.

00:43:10.046 --> 00:43:13.016
All of us will try to keep her
as happy as we can.

00:43:13.246 --> 00:43:14.076
What do you say?

00:43:15.286 --> 00:43:16.386
Why did you talk like that, Guna?

00:43:16.776 --> 00:43:18.256
We won't leave your mom.

00:43:18.756 --> 00:43:20.256
Guna, I am with them.

00:43:21.206 --> 00:43:22.256
We all are here.

00:43:22.416 --> 00:43:23.546
Don't cry.
We will take care.

00:43:25.376 --> 00:43:27.236
Okay, don't cry.
Guna, we all are there.

00:43:27.296 --> 00:43:28.966
Don't cry...
- We will take care.

00:43:29.006 --> 00:43:29.866
Don't cry.

00:43:47.596 --> 00:43:48.416
Hey, Guna.

00:43:56.186 --> 00:43:58.046
Sir.. Move, Rocky.

00:43:58.736 --> 00:44:00.346
Hey.. Where are you going?

00:44:15.396 --> 00:44:16.296
Teju..

00:44:17.316 --> 00:44:18.306
Did you join back?

00:44:21.846 --> 00:44:23.666
Yes.
- Oh.

00:44:25.376 --> 00:44:26.336
It's fine, Teju.

00:44:26.816 --> 00:44:28.246
All problems come at the same time.

00:44:28.926 --> 00:44:31.306
What will you do now?
Don't feel bad.

00:44:34.166 --> 00:44:35.166
Who are you calling a problem?

00:44:37.716 --> 00:44:39.546
Teju, I wanted to say something.

00:44:40.096 --> 00:44:41.046
What do I say?

00:44:41.636 --> 00:44:43.006
I think I conveyed it wrongly.

00:44:43.796 --> 00:44:44.666
Forget it.

00:44:45.006 --> 00:44:46.796
I-I don't have any work now.

00:44:47.326 --> 00:44:48.756
But, I am scared to be here.

00:44:49.916 --> 00:44:51.796
S-Shall I leave
before you say anything?

00:44:52.706 --> 00:44:53.536
I shouldn’t?

00:44:54.336 --> 00:44:55.296
I will leave on my own.

00:46:04.487 --> 00:46:07.267
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:46:09.497 --> 00:46:11.817
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:46:14.507 --> 00:46:17.307
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:46:19.157 --> 00:46:21.427
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:46:21.657 --> 00:46:24.107
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:46:24.207 --> 00:46:26.637
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:46:26.987 --> 00:46:29.487
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:46:31.937 --> 00:46:34.607
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:46:36.987 --> 00:46:39.517
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:46:41.727 --> 00:46:45.747
♪ In it, I am also a doctor ♪

00:47:09.347 --> 00:47:10.347
Reena..

00:47:11.807 --> 00:47:13.997
You look brighter
than your vehicle.

00:47:14.357 --> 00:47:15.477
Is it a good time ahead?

00:47:16.827 --> 00:47:18.807
No, why are you asking like that?

00:47:19.587 --> 00:47:21.687
You and Arjun have become friends.

00:47:23.087 --> 00:47:24.847
How do you know what is
happening in the hospital?

00:47:25.207 --> 00:47:26.667
I have a source in the hospital.

00:47:27.207 --> 00:47:28.387
Who is that source?
- Rocky..

00:47:31.097 --> 00:47:33.597
Uncle, I don't know
what Rocky has told you.

00:47:33.997 --> 00:47:35.427
Arjun and I are just friends.

00:47:35.937 --> 00:47:37.457
Don't be so old school.

00:47:38.027 --> 00:47:38.967
It's not like that.

00:47:39.197 --> 00:47:40.797
You have become
a part of our family.

00:47:41.037 --> 00:47:42.617
It's our responsibility
to protect you.

00:47:43.157 --> 00:47:45.937
Rocky is helping us a lot.
You know, he is a good boy.

00:47:47.407 --> 00:47:49.587
In fact, I heard that Radhi
has joined the hospital again.

00:47:52.587 --> 00:47:54.187
Why is Rocky telling
you everything?

00:47:54.377 --> 00:47:55.637
Is he a friend to me or you?

00:47:56.277 --> 00:47:57.107
That little...

00:47:57.707 --> 00:47:58.577
No, no.

00:47:59.137 --> 00:48:00.447
Rocky didn't tell me that.

00:48:01.277 --> 00:48:04.077
Thyagu was giving
sweets to everyone on the street

00:48:04.137 --> 00:48:05.597
as if his daughter
graduated high school.

00:48:05.807 --> 00:48:08.267
I asked him why
and only he told me this.

00:48:10.487 --> 00:48:12.667
I understand your enthusiasm
in getting to work.

00:48:13.667 --> 00:48:14.487
Go ahead.

00:48:15.597 --> 00:48:18.347
Uncle, things are going well.
Don't jinx it.

00:48:18.727 --> 00:48:20.127
I don't jinx anything.

00:48:20.247 --> 00:48:21.787
I am a good boy, I am a good boy.

00:48:23.097 --> 00:48:24.727
How are you going to go?
The tyre is punctured.

00:48:25.867 --> 00:48:27.637
Puncture?
- Yes, a big one.

00:48:29.117 --> 00:48:30.187
All of this is for good.

00:48:30.567 --> 00:48:32.447
Do something.
Take an auto.

00:48:32.787 --> 00:48:34.477
Arjun will drop you back home.
He will drop you.

00:48:39.417 --> 00:48:41.017
I don't know if it is my luck

00:48:41.047 --> 00:48:42.687
but everyone around me is crazy.
- What?

00:48:43.257 --> 00:48:45.017
Nothing, Uncle.
- Okay.

00:49:03.097 --> 00:49:03.917
Dev.

00:49:06.497 --> 00:49:08.557
I have rejoined the hospital.

00:49:10.727 --> 00:49:13.937
I'm going to work only
as a senior consultant.

00:49:15.047 --> 00:49:16.917
I told Arjun clearly
that I won't take up

00:49:16.937 --> 00:49:18.807
any responsibilities
of the hospital.

00:49:20.867 --> 00:49:21.897
Why are you telling me this?

00:49:22.727 --> 00:49:24.057
What do you mean, Dev?

00:49:25.037 --> 00:49:26.307
You should know everything, right?

00:49:27.817 --> 00:49:30.447
I feel like things are slowly
getting sorted now.

00:49:31.637 --> 00:49:33.517
It feels like
the calm after a storm.

00:49:38.797 --> 00:49:41.057
Dev, shall we go to some temple?

00:49:46.317 --> 00:49:50.227
Look, what is happening in your
life is none of my business.

00:49:50.857 --> 00:49:53.517
I have never interfered in your
career and I will never do so.

00:49:54.257 --> 00:49:56.437
I tried to explain the same
thing to you the other day.

00:49:56.907 --> 00:49:58.767
And that does not mean
I have accepted you.

00:49:59.307 --> 00:50:00.867
It was the restaurant that day
and now this.

00:50:01.137 --> 00:50:03.347
If you talk as if nothing happened
and that everything is solved

00:50:04.397 --> 00:50:05.637
does that mean everything is fine?

00:50:06.777 --> 00:50:07.597
Look.

00:50:07.887 --> 00:50:12.097
Nothing can be changed,
forgotten or forgiven.

00:50:13.437 --> 00:50:14.347
Don't try again.

00:50:16.037 --> 00:50:16.917
Dev...

00:50:28.577 --> 00:50:29.407
What is this, Mom?

00:50:29.647 --> 00:50:31.557
You are going
to the hospital again.

00:50:31.767 --> 00:50:34.477
Are you thinking
about how to punish someone?

00:50:34.897 --> 00:50:37.017
You won't bother
with us anymore, right?

00:50:38.717 --> 00:50:39.807
It's nothing like that, Divi.

00:50:40.347 --> 00:50:41.197
Mom.

00:50:41.867 --> 00:50:45.897
Shall we go to a temple
someday? It will be peaceful.

00:50:48.977 --> 00:50:49.787
Let's go.

00:50:57.777 --> 00:50:59.547
Stop here.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:51:03.757 --> 00:51:05.757
Here, thanks.
- Okay.

00:51:06.097 --> 00:51:08.447
Reena, why are you
coming in an auto?

00:51:09.017 --> 00:51:10.057
What happened to your vehicle?

00:51:11.667 --> 00:51:12.727
There's a puncture...
- Oh...

00:51:14.687 --> 00:51:18.347
Then shall I drop you
in the evening?

00:51:19.907 --> 00:51:21.367
Did Uncle Ganesh call you?

00:51:22.267 --> 00:51:23.507
No. Why?

00:51:24.217 --> 00:51:25.437
Just asked.

00:51:26.017 --> 00:51:27.977
I'll take a cab.
Thanks for asking.

00:51:28.607 --> 00:51:29.427
Wait a minute.

00:51:31.977 --> 00:51:33.057
I need to talk to you.

00:51:33.287 --> 00:51:34.187
What is it?

00:51:34.757 --> 00:51:35.787
Do you know that Teju has come?

00:51:39.137 --> 00:51:40.897
Dr. Radhi has joined again.

00:51:41.807 --> 00:51:42.767
Teju has also rejoined.

00:51:43.987 --> 00:51:44.807
And...

00:51:45.157 --> 00:51:48.937
The hospital problems
are very overwhelming.

00:51:50.847 --> 00:51:52.287
I need to talk to someone.

00:51:52.747 --> 00:51:54.557
Overwhelming? Because of Teju?

00:51:56.077 --> 00:51:57.767
Well, it's not like that.

00:51:58.747 --> 00:52:02.477
But, it's overwhelming
that Dr. Radhi has rejoined.

00:52:03.687 --> 00:52:07.167
So, are we close enough
to share our problems?

00:52:08.637 --> 00:52:10.307
It's all
a part of friendship, right?

00:52:12.957 --> 00:52:14.307
I don't know whom to talk to.

00:52:15.407 --> 00:52:17.017
I don't feel like trusting
anyone except you.

00:52:18.727 --> 00:52:20.267
But, I don't feel
like trusting you.

00:52:22.887 --> 00:52:24.767
Shall I share it or not?

00:52:26.567 --> 00:52:27.397
Tell me.

00:52:29.487 --> 00:52:30.427
I'll have a coffee.

00:52:34.267 --> 00:52:36.017
What do they talk about?

00:52:37.517 --> 00:52:38.397
What do you think it is?

00:52:42.617 --> 00:52:43.637
What do you think it is?

00:52:45.187 --> 00:52:47.877
Arjun would've complained to Reena
that I have rejoined this hospital.

00:52:49.617 --> 00:52:50.767
After hearing that

00:52:50.827 --> 00:52:52.437
Reena would have defended you
and fought with him.

00:52:52.467 --> 00:52:56.007
As if. She would be planning how
to chase me out of the hospital.

00:52:56.217 --> 00:52:59.017
Hey.. Reena wouldn't
even dream of that.

00:53:02.067 --> 00:53:05.437
Teju, why don't you join my team?

00:53:06.767 --> 00:53:07.617
What?

00:53:07.947 --> 00:53:10.767
No, will you accept me
in your team?

00:53:11.897 --> 00:53:14.227
Am I here to rob or murder someone?

00:53:14.317 --> 00:53:15.717
One of those things
would've happened.

00:53:16.057 --> 00:53:18.137
Mr. RK saved you.
You just missed it.

00:53:20.437 --> 00:53:21.337
Sorry.

00:53:22.427 --> 00:53:25.437
But, if a powerful person
like you is in my team

00:53:25.877 --> 00:53:27.267
it'll be more supportive to me.

00:53:28.397 --> 00:53:30.307
There's already
someone in my team.

00:53:30.907 --> 00:53:34.017
Instead of two of us
coming to you.

00:53:34.527 --> 00:53:36.717
It would be easier
if you join our team.

00:53:36.937 --> 00:53:37.807
That's why I asked.

00:53:39.397 --> 00:53:41.437
Who is that other person?
- Nilofer.

00:53:43.347 --> 00:53:46.327
Great! You are a blabbermouth
and she is an over-enthusiast.

00:53:46.957 --> 00:53:49.847
If I join your team, I'll be
the first one to get caught.

00:53:50.587 --> 00:53:53.127
If I get caught with you,
I'll be ashamed.

00:53:54.817 --> 00:53:58.357
If you ask me something like this
again, I'll break your jaw.

00:53:58.907 --> 00:53:59.807
Got it?

00:54:05.057 --> 00:54:06.017
Did she pay for the coffee?

00:54:06.307 --> 00:54:07.597
No.
- She won't, I know...

00:54:11.527 --> 00:54:12.347
What is this, Amaya?

00:54:12.677 --> 00:54:14.597
You asked us to come on time.
But now you are late.

00:54:16.397 --> 00:54:17.487
What's this disguise?

00:54:18.297 --> 00:54:19.397
Are you going to rob a bank?

00:54:19.677 --> 00:54:20.747
Like a heist or something?

00:54:20.917 --> 00:54:24.667
I'm scared to come out
in this heat, Doctor.

00:54:25.407 --> 00:54:28.267
Our work is so hectic. I don't get
any time to take care of my skin.

00:54:29.087 --> 00:54:31.057
I have to walk
from home to the hospital.

00:54:31.577 --> 00:54:33.337
My body is getting tanned.

00:54:35.177 --> 00:54:37.377
It'll turn into
hyperpigmentation, that's why.

00:54:43.387 --> 00:54:45.597
Pond Skin Institute,
Sun Miracle Sunscreen.

00:54:46.657 --> 00:54:47.847
Try this, Amaya.

00:54:48.197 --> 00:54:50.077
This is the best companion
for my skin.

00:54:50.287 --> 00:54:52.397
I apply it daily in the morning
and keep it in my bag.

00:54:52.657 --> 00:54:54.397
I use it whenever I need it.

00:54:55.297 --> 00:54:57.927
It has SPF 50 plus and niacinamide.

00:54:58.047 --> 00:55:01.557
It prevents skin damage
and lightens dark spots.

00:55:01.997 --> 00:55:04.097
So this is my skincare secret.

00:55:09.637 --> 00:55:12.417
Doctor, I don't even feel it
on the skin after applying.

00:55:12.517 --> 00:55:13.767
It feels very light.

00:55:14.667 --> 00:55:15.597
Thanks, Doctor.

00:55:15.887 --> 00:55:17.177
It's okay, you can keep it.

00:55:26.227 --> 00:55:28.447
You seem to be happy with your job.

00:55:29.097 --> 00:55:31.847
But I can't concentrate
on anything here.

00:55:33.267 --> 00:55:36.057
Teju, how can I understand
if you randomly talk like this?

00:55:36.417 --> 00:55:38.597
I was so peaceful
when I worked in that small clinic.

00:55:39.277 --> 00:55:41.727
But I came here when you asked.
So I am to be blamed.

00:55:42.557 --> 00:55:43.937
I can't work here.

00:55:44.757 --> 00:55:46.047
When did I ask you to come?

00:55:46.277 --> 00:55:47.307
I said it was your wish.

00:55:47.647 --> 00:55:49.507
You said you wouldn't come
but now you're here.

00:55:54.057 --> 00:55:55.327
Anyway, what happened?

00:55:55.677 --> 00:55:56.517
What else should happen?

00:55:57.647 --> 00:55:59.437
Everyone treats me
differently here.

00:55:59.817 --> 00:56:02.307
Everyone talks to me about the past
or they point fingers at me.

00:56:04.727 --> 00:56:05.587
Trust me, Teju.

00:56:05.847 --> 00:56:07.807
No one understands
this better than me.

00:56:08.067 --> 00:56:09.707
Because I'm in the same situation.

00:56:09.937 --> 00:56:11.227
This is new to me too.

00:56:12.447 --> 00:56:14.557
But no other way.
We have to face it.

00:56:15.467 --> 00:56:16.297
Ma'am.

00:56:16.907 --> 00:56:18.097
There's an emergency in the ER.

00:56:18.347 --> 00:56:19.177
Yeah.

00:56:27.487 --> 00:56:28.397
Is it him?
- Yes, ma'am.

00:56:29.347 --> 00:56:30.167
Hey..

00:56:32.127 --> 00:56:33.977
Sir, Aruna said that
he's my patient.

00:56:34.037 --> 00:56:35.017
Is he your patient?
- Aruna.

00:56:35.807 --> 00:56:36.897
Did you check properly?

00:56:37.567 --> 00:56:39.097
You asked me
to examine this patient, right?

00:56:40.877 --> 00:56:43.807
Sir, you take a look.
I think Aruna was confused.

00:56:43.847 --> 00:56:45.897
No, no, Dr. Radhi.
You can examine him.

00:56:46.677 --> 00:56:49.307
No, it's okay, sir. You go ahead.
- What does it matter? You do it.

00:56:50.257 --> 00:56:51.097
Are you sure?

00:56:51.297 --> 00:56:52.307
Sure. Take a look.

00:56:56.297 --> 00:56:57.127
Reports?

00:57:01.847 --> 00:57:03.097
The patient's name
is Sathish, ma'am.

00:57:03.197 --> 00:57:05.517
He fainted while riding his bike.

00:57:05.667 --> 00:57:06.977
He suffered an injury to the head.

00:57:07.387 --> 00:57:10.017
They tried to wake him up,
but he didn't get up.

00:57:10.297 --> 00:57:12.087
So, they admitted him
to the hospital.

00:57:12.287 --> 00:57:13.967
When they shifted him to the bed

00:57:13.997 --> 00:57:16.977
we found this inhaler
from his pocket.

00:57:17.937 --> 00:57:18.767
Okay.

00:57:19.477 --> 00:57:20.437
Did you take a CT scan?

00:57:20.707 --> 00:57:24.477
No, ma'am. Since he has a head
injury, we just did the dressing.

00:57:24.717 --> 00:57:25.547
Okay.

00:57:26.237 --> 00:57:28.897
Take a CT scan immediately. I need
the reports as soon as possible.

00:57:28.917 --> 00:57:29.907
Okay, ma'am.
- And..

00:57:30.017 --> 00:57:32.187
Start the broad
spectrum antibiotics.

00:57:32.387 --> 00:57:34.637
And also start
the blood investigation.

00:57:34.867 --> 00:57:35.707
Okay, ma'am.

00:57:35.807 --> 00:57:39.057
Ma'am...
- And yes, oxygen therapy too.

00:57:39.097 --> 00:57:40.967
Yes, sir.
- After I checked him

00:57:41.017 --> 00:57:42.937
I have a hunch that it's pneumonia.

00:57:43.497 --> 00:57:45.257
Based on that possibility...

00:57:45.957 --> 00:57:46.977
You can start the treatment.

00:57:48.687 --> 00:57:52.057
Sir, you can handle this patient.
I'll take care of other cases.

00:57:52.097 --> 00:57:54.267
Ma'am, I was just
sharing my thoughts.

00:57:54.427 --> 00:57:56.307
If it disturbs you, let me know.
I shall leave.

00:57:56.387 --> 00:57:59.847
No, no. I was just…
- You carry on. I'll leave.

00:58:08.087 --> 00:58:09.307
Ma'am, the patient is awake.

00:58:11.097 --> 00:58:12.767
Sir, you are in the hospital.

00:58:12.827 --> 00:58:14.267
Do you remember
what happened to you?

00:58:14.337 --> 00:58:17.527
While I was riding
my bike on the road

00:58:18.767 --> 00:58:20.057
I suddenly fainted.

00:58:20.947 --> 00:58:22.017
I don't know what happened next.

00:58:23.827 --> 00:58:25.097
Do you smoke?

00:58:25.627 --> 00:58:26.517
No.

00:58:27.347 --> 00:58:29.447
Do you have any medical conditions?

00:58:29.627 --> 00:58:32.057
Do you have any breathing issues
or any lung problem?

00:58:32.397 --> 00:58:33.347
I just have wheezing.

00:58:33.607 --> 00:58:34.637
Oh, okay.

00:58:35.837 --> 00:58:36.937
What about the CT process?

00:58:37.317 --> 00:58:38.137
Naveen.
- Sir.

00:58:39.317 --> 00:58:40.917
You stay
with this patient, Sathish.

00:58:41.157 --> 00:58:42.237
Keep me updated.

00:58:42.707 --> 00:58:43.517
Okay, sir.
- Go.

00:58:48.437 --> 00:58:50.477
Ma'am, if you are okay with it

00:58:51.077 --> 00:58:53.437
can I work with Teju on this case?

00:58:54.007 --> 00:58:54.847
No, ma'am.

00:58:55.557 --> 00:58:57.137
He is working with Dr. Preetham.

00:58:57.227 --> 00:58:59.057
Maybe he has asked him to check
what we are doing.

00:59:00.527 --> 00:59:02.687
Ma'am, he did send me here.

00:59:03.007 --> 00:59:04.597
He asked me to keep him updated.

00:59:05.597 --> 00:59:06.637
He is the chief doctor.

00:59:06.987 --> 00:59:09.367
I can't disobey him, ma'am.

00:59:11.067 --> 00:59:12.017
Please consider it.

00:59:18.347 --> 00:59:20.697
Okay, Naveen.
You and Teju can work together.

00:59:21.887 --> 00:59:22.977
Why is Radhi like this?

00:59:24.137 --> 00:59:26.057
She is letting me
take care of that patient

00:59:26.797 --> 00:59:28.937
as if I don't have any other
patients to take care of.

00:59:29.067 --> 00:59:29.897
No, no.

00:59:30.157 --> 00:59:32.367
It's completely
normal for two doctors

00:59:32.847 --> 00:59:35.017
to discuss a case
and to pitch their ideas.

00:59:35.287 --> 00:59:36.137
It is normal, sir.

00:59:36.467 --> 00:59:38.017
Did you check outside?
- Where, sir?

00:59:38.097 --> 00:59:39.937
So many patients are
waiting for my appointment.

00:59:39.967 --> 00:59:42.557
Yes, sir.
- Is she donating to me?

00:59:43.197 --> 00:59:45.727
No, sir. She didn't
mean it like that.

00:59:45.977 --> 00:59:47.517
She said it casually.

00:59:47.857 --> 00:59:50.357
Hey, are you working
for me or for Radhi?

00:59:50.397 --> 00:59:51.307
For you, sir.

00:59:51.657 --> 00:59:54.187
I have to do something about Radhi.
- Sir.

00:59:56.567 --> 00:59:58.057
I need to talk to you in private.

01:00:05.937 --> 01:00:07.437
How is Ganga's case going on?

01:00:08.047 --> 01:00:09.727
Sir, I'm observing
her continuously.

01:00:10.007 --> 01:00:11.877
I am submitting reports
to you from time to time.

01:00:11.907 --> 01:00:12.737
I know.

01:00:16.127 --> 01:00:17.347
Reena.
- Sir.

01:00:19.267 --> 01:00:20.517
You can relieve yourself
from this case.

01:00:23.727 --> 01:00:26.397
Don't get involved in this case
under any circumstances.

01:00:27.517 --> 01:00:28.347
But, sir...

01:00:28.727 --> 01:00:30.227
You asked me to take over.

01:00:30.907 --> 01:00:33.097
I am doing everything
according to the procedure.

01:00:34.757 --> 01:00:35.637
I know.

01:00:37.337 --> 01:00:39.437
I gave you this case
based on your potential.

01:00:40.497 --> 01:00:41.937
You didn't do
anything wrong, Reena.

01:00:43.377 --> 01:00:44.267
But..

01:00:45.377 --> 01:00:47.657
I am under heavy pressure
from the management.

01:00:48.237 --> 01:00:49.087
I can't do anything.

01:00:49.897 --> 01:00:50.897
I don't understand, sir.

01:00:52.167 --> 01:00:56.267
The management has asked you
to be relieved from this case.

01:00:57.227 --> 01:00:59.817
I tried talking to them
in your support, but..

01:01:00.977 --> 01:01:01.937
No one listened to me.

01:01:02.667 --> 01:01:03.887
What are you trying to say now?

01:01:04.317 --> 01:01:06.597
You are going to relieve me from
this case because Arjun said so.

01:01:06.977 --> 01:01:07.797
Am I right?

01:01:10.347 --> 01:01:11.937
I can understand your anger, Reena.

01:01:15.917 --> 01:01:16.767
Arjun told me.

01:01:17.667 --> 01:01:19.297
But, it didn't come
from the management.

01:01:20.197 --> 01:01:22.147
Radhi has told Arjun.

01:01:22.847 --> 01:01:23.937
And Arjun told me.

01:01:24.717 --> 01:01:26.137
That you should be
relieved from this case.

01:01:27.047 --> 01:01:29.897
Radhi is feeling that you shouldn't
get involved in this case anymore.

01:01:31.347 --> 01:01:32.397
Did she tell you this?

01:01:33.677 --> 01:01:34.637
Yes.

01:01:39.767 --> 01:01:40.617
Okay, sir.

01:01:41.067 --> 01:01:42.767
I will take care of it.
- I am sorry, Reena.

01:01:43.587 --> 01:01:44.867
It's okay, sir. Thank you.

01:01:49.697 --> 01:01:50.527
Hey, Kamal.
- Sir.

01:01:51.787 --> 01:01:52.847
Why is she reacting like this?

01:01:53.557 --> 01:01:55.267
If not this,
we will allocate another case.

01:01:55.867 --> 01:01:56.737
It's normal, sir.

01:01:57.187 --> 01:01:59.057
How can her mother
do this to her?

01:02:00.007 --> 01:02:02.047
Mother?
- Yes, sir. Didn't you know?

01:02:02.397 --> 01:02:03.617
Reena is Radhi's daughter.

01:02:04.097 --> 01:02:06.597
Everyone in the hospital knows it.
I thought you also knew.

01:02:07.547 --> 01:02:09.267
That's okay, you are new here.

01:02:09.687 --> 01:02:10.897
You will get to know everything.

01:02:11.307 --> 01:02:12.097
Hello.
- Sir?

01:02:12.787 --> 01:02:14.227
You joined after I did.

01:02:14.347 --> 01:02:15.557
Are you calling me new?

01:02:15.747 --> 01:02:16.637
Oh, no, my bad.

01:02:25.387 --> 01:02:27.727
I am a good doctor, right?
- You are a superb doctor!

01:03:34.123 --> 01:03:37.453
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:03:39.163 --> 01:03:41.663
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:03:44.253 --> 01:03:47.283
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:03:49.023 --> 01:03:51.183
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:03:51.513 --> 01:03:53.913
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:03:54.043 --> 01:03:56.613
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:03:56.843 --> 01:03:59.313
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:04:01.833 --> 01:04:04.343
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:04:06.833 --> 01:04:09.333
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:04:11.593 --> 01:04:16.113
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:04:35.623 --> 01:04:37.703
Did you come back
to drive me out of the hospital?

01:04:38.703 --> 01:04:42.413
You used your influence
to transfer the case to Anitha.

01:04:43.463 --> 01:04:45.703
You are doing this because
I am handling this case.

01:04:46.663 --> 01:04:47.533
Look, Reena.

01:04:48.453 --> 01:04:52.033
Anitha assisted me
in Ganga's previous surgeries.

01:04:52.453 --> 01:04:54.663
Now Dr. Preetham
is handling that case.

01:04:54.743 --> 01:04:56.083
This case is new for them.

01:04:56.663 --> 01:04:59.283
We need someone as knowledgeable
as Anitha in this case.

01:04:59.603 --> 01:05:01.843
Otherwise, it will be a risk
to the patient's life, Reena.

01:05:02.073 --> 01:05:03.663
How can you decide that?

01:05:04.183 --> 01:05:07.163
How can you say whether
I can handle this case or not?

01:05:07.383 --> 01:05:10.073
The chief doctor himself assigned
me the case because I can handle it.

01:05:10.353 --> 01:05:11.353
When that is the case...

01:05:11.553 --> 01:05:15.213
How can you assume that it will
be a risk to the patient's life?

01:05:16.163 --> 01:05:17.743
I didn't think like that, Reena.

01:05:18.033 --> 01:05:19.203
Think like a professional.

01:05:19.873 --> 01:05:22.813
In Ganga's case,
the complication is her age.

01:05:23.323 --> 01:05:25.503
So there is a high chance
of things going wrong.

01:05:25.873 --> 01:05:29.483
Anitha is experienced in handling it
and she has exposure in this case.

01:05:30.943 --> 01:05:32.793
You are seeing this
as an opportunity, Reena.

01:05:33.493 --> 01:05:36.233
Even if there's a small mistake,
the patient's life will be at risk.

01:05:37.023 --> 01:05:38.793
You are not doing this
for the patient.

01:05:39.493 --> 01:05:41.263
You are targeting me.
- Reena!

01:05:41.853 --> 01:05:44.353
You are not the chief doctor now
to do whatever you want.

01:05:45.033 --> 01:05:47.783
No matter what happens,
I will handle this case.

01:05:48.323 --> 01:05:49.313
and that too, successfully.

01:05:50.183 --> 01:05:51.063
You will see that.

01:06:00.253 --> 01:06:01.393
Shall we leave, ma'am?
- Yes

01:06:05.223 --> 01:06:06.103
Hey!

01:06:06.483 --> 01:06:07.483
Where are you both going?

01:06:08.183 --> 01:06:09.873
Come on, let's go together.

01:06:10.053 --> 01:06:12.373
But, where?
- Just to roam around the city.

01:06:14.193 --> 01:06:15.243
Why are you looking
at me like that?

01:06:15.583 --> 01:06:17.703
I know that you were
crying in the interns' room.

01:06:17.893 --> 01:06:20.243
You were worried, wondering
how to make her happy, right?

01:06:20.383 --> 01:06:22.663
That's why I went
to ask her for help.

01:06:22.903 --> 01:06:25.813
She said that we can go out.
That's why we got ready.

01:06:26.033 --> 01:06:27.523
You also come with us.
- Senior!

01:06:28.393 --> 01:06:29.893
How can you ask me
to take her out in this condition?

01:06:30.893 --> 01:06:33.083
How can you do this
after knowing everything?

01:06:34.683 --> 01:06:36.083
Why are you
looking at her like that?

01:06:36.323 --> 01:06:38.533
I felt that it would be fun
if we all go together.

01:06:38.763 --> 01:06:39.773
That's why.

01:06:40.153 --> 01:06:41.433
Come with us, please.

01:06:43.713 --> 01:06:45.533
Okay, Mom.
Don't look so gloomy.

01:06:46.253 --> 01:06:47.103
Let's go.

01:06:49.943 --> 01:06:51.233
Okay, I will change my dress.
- Okay.

01:06:54.703 --> 01:06:56.173
Ma'am...
- Mom!

01:06:56.413 --> 01:06:57.233
Sit down...

01:06:57.343 --> 01:06:58.523
Mom! Are you alright?
- Sit down.

01:06:58.873 --> 01:07:00.173
Get some water.
I'll get the pills.

01:07:01.743 --> 01:07:02.703
What happened, Mom?

01:07:03.333 --> 01:07:04.813
Senior! Hurry up.
- Here you go.

01:07:06.043 --> 01:07:06.903
Slowly.

01:07:10.033 --> 01:07:10.893
Are you okay?

01:07:11.493 --> 01:07:12.433
Are you okay, Mom?

01:07:13.833 --> 01:07:15.853
Senior! This is why
I told you not to go out.

01:07:16.863 --> 01:07:17.843
Why?

01:07:18.653 --> 01:07:19.953
Mom! Why are you doing this?

01:07:20.453 --> 01:07:21.703
We don't have to go out.

01:07:22.503 --> 01:07:23.433
We can be happy here.

01:07:25.383 --> 01:07:26.593
Don't strain yourself.

01:07:32.033 --> 01:07:33.283
Even I didn't know.

01:07:35.123 --> 01:07:36.073
What to do?

01:07:36.983 --> 01:07:38.083
You will be happy.

01:07:39.883 --> 01:07:40.723
That's why.

01:07:41.583 --> 01:07:46.733
The memories that I couldn't
give you when you were young

01:07:48.073 --> 01:07:52.083
In the few days that I have left
with you now...

01:07:52.453 --> 01:07:54.623
I want to spend time with you.
- What is this, Mom?

01:07:56.363 --> 01:07:58.953
But, I don't know how to do that.

01:08:00.903 --> 01:08:01.733
You tell me.

01:08:02.693 --> 01:08:05.273
What can I do to make you happy?

01:08:12.343 --> 01:08:13.933
Don't get so sentimental.

01:08:14.413 --> 01:08:15.393
Tell me the truth.

01:08:21.193 --> 01:08:22.033
Mom...

01:08:22.783 --> 01:08:26.453
I have seen you dancing
when I was young.

01:08:27.853 --> 01:08:30.453
Since I was too young

01:08:31.243 --> 01:08:32.473
I don't remember it clearly.

01:08:35.133 --> 01:08:37.993
I went to the hostel
after I grew up.

01:08:39.093 --> 01:08:43.183
Then, I didn't get a chance
to see you dance.

01:08:45.643 --> 01:08:47.933
I like your performance.

01:08:49.313 --> 01:08:53.143
Will you perform for me just once?

01:08:56.233 --> 01:08:58.703
It's not a big deal.
I can do it.

01:09:01.123 --> 01:09:02.413
But, there is one condition.

01:09:02.713 --> 01:09:04.963
The performance shouldn't
be longer than a minute.

01:09:08.363 --> 01:09:09.233
Okay?

01:09:09.953 --> 01:09:10.833
Okay.

01:09:14.203 --> 01:09:15.843
If you listen to her,
the patient will die.

01:09:16.093 --> 01:09:17.783
As if he will save the patient.

01:09:17.963 --> 01:09:19.743
He doesn't know
how to take care of a patient.

01:09:19.913 --> 01:09:21.573
Where is the cinema doctor?

01:09:21.813 --> 01:09:24.083
He has gone to another hospital
as a guest doctor.

01:09:24.333 --> 01:09:26.353
There’s been an emergency situation
going on for a month.

01:09:26.423 --> 01:09:28.823
Some of our staff members
have also gone there.

01:09:30.633 --> 01:09:32.063
You never get a case.
What are you doing?

01:09:32.113 --> 01:09:33.983
Guys, who knows Bharatanatyam?

01:09:34.223 --> 01:09:36.273
Bharatanatyam?
- Bharatanatyam?

01:09:36.493 --> 01:09:38.563
Bharatanatyam?
- Bharatanatyam?

01:09:39.353 --> 01:09:42.203
I asked you if you could dance.
Why are you reacting like this?

01:09:42.343 --> 01:09:43.453
Can you dance or not?

01:09:44.483 --> 01:09:45.853
Senior, I can.
- No...

01:09:46.293 --> 01:09:48.023
Can you, really?
- Anitha, I can dance too.

01:09:48.493 --> 01:09:50.143
Aruna, what are you saying?

01:09:50.513 --> 01:09:52.453
Is that's why when you
remove your ID card

01:09:52.563 --> 01:09:54.103
you do it so gracefully?

01:09:58.823 --> 01:10:00.663
Reena, can you dance?

01:10:00.933 --> 01:10:02.933
I know confidently
that Reena cannot dance.

01:10:04.383 --> 01:10:05.273
I can dance.

01:10:06.083 --> 01:10:07.653
Hey, what are you saying?

01:10:08.173 --> 01:10:09.613
You don't even
wear your shoes properly.

01:10:09.743 --> 01:10:11.203
Do you know Bharatanatyam?

01:10:11.363 --> 01:10:12.733
Yes, I do.

01:10:13.683 --> 01:10:15.743
Then why didn't you
ever perform for me?

01:10:16.063 --> 01:10:18.483
Why do I have to dance
in the workplace?

01:10:20.223 --> 01:10:21.093
Good point.

01:10:21.953 --> 01:10:24.993
Why are you asking
if anyone know Bharatanatyam?

01:10:25.503 --> 01:10:28.563
Guna's mother wanted
to create a memory for him.

01:10:28.783 --> 01:10:30.543
That too to make him happy.

01:10:30.933 --> 01:10:33.043
So when I asked Guna

01:10:33.233 --> 01:10:36.063
Guna said it would be great
if his mother performed.

01:10:36.433 --> 01:10:37.313
That's why.

01:10:40.123 --> 01:10:41.533
Senior, when and where?

01:10:41.903 --> 01:10:43.623
Our hospital anniversary.

01:10:43.793 --> 01:10:45.853
Superb.
- I'm okay with it.

01:10:47.443 --> 01:10:49.883
Superb.
Let's practice in the gap we get.

01:10:50.293 --> 01:10:51.263
Okay, senior.

01:10:53.283 --> 01:10:54.313
I'm not doing it.

01:10:54.453 --> 01:10:55.293
Why?

01:10:59.153 --> 01:11:01.373
I have a lot of work here
and not only that...

01:11:01.523 --> 01:11:02.943
I'm not interested in dancing.

01:11:04.793 --> 01:11:07.023
Reena, you saw Guna
crying here the other day.

01:11:07.363 --> 01:11:09.463
We're doing it for his mother.
Senior, she'll dance.

01:11:09.813 --> 01:11:11.233
You'll dance, right?

01:11:22.193 --> 01:11:23.963
Amaya, coffee.

01:11:24.983 --> 01:11:27.313
You're not in uniform
and your hairstyle is great.

01:11:27.373 --> 01:11:28.313
Did you have other plans?

01:11:28.543 --> 01:11:30.013
Hey, who are you?

01:11:30.573 --> 01:11:31.623
Who is she talking about?

01:11:32.873 --> 01:11:34.643
Don't joke around.
Don't you know who I am?

01:11:34.783 --> 01:11:35.703
I don't know.

01:11:40.083 --> 01:11:41.023
Oh, no.

01:11:41.743 --> 01:11:43.693
Okay, forget it.
Drink your coffee.

01:11:43.933 --> 01:11:46.553
I don't know who you are. Why
are you asking me to drink coffee?

01:11:47.003 --> 01:11:51.023
I indeed asked you to
call me by my name.

01:11:51.363 --> 01:11:53.353
But this is...
Fine, it's okay.

01:11:53.623 --> 01:11:54.913
Okay, you can call me like that.

01:11:54.983 --> 01:11:56.233
What is she doing here?

01:11:56.453 --> 01:12:00.523
Guna's mother is going to perform
Bharatanatyam for her son.

01:12:00.703 --> 01:12:03.773
We want to dance together.
Do you know Bharatanatyam?

01:12:04.473 --> 01:12:05.723
I only know freestyle.

01:12:07.413 --> 01:12:09.623
That's also an art.
So what?

01:12:09.683 --> 01:12:11.943
I've never seen you talk like this.

01:12:12.573 --> 01:12:14.403
It's a prank.
You are trying to prank me.

01:12:14.523 --> 01:12:15.393
Hey.

01:12:19.073 --> 01:12:20.273
Okay, I think you’re angry.

01:12:21.123 --> 01:12:22.673
It's because you are in a bad mood.

01:12:23.143 --> 01:12:24.893
Drink your coffee
or it will get cold.

01:12:25.193 --> 01:12:26.793
I'll go and drink it alone.

01:12:28.783 --> 01:12:29.743
Idiot.

01:12:38.543 --> 01:12:40.373
Abhi, what are you doing here?

01:12:41.153 --> 01:12:42.653
Why did you talk to him like that?

01:12:42.843 --> 01:12:44.073
What's going on between you two?

01:12:46.083 --> 01:12:48.273
Nothing.
He's a doctor here.

01:12:48.473 --> 01:12:49.523
That's why.

01:12:50.323 --> 01:12:51.583
Look, Amaya.

01:12:51.723 --> 01:12:54.043
You know how many problems
we're facing at home.

01:12:54.203 --> 01:12:56.193
We all depend on you.

01:12:56.363 --> 01:12:58.103
Don't get
into unnecessary problems.

01:12:58.903 --> 01:13:00.413
I know what I'm doing.

01:13:00.983 --> 01:13:02.273
Why did you come here?

01:13:04.443 --> 01:13:06.413
I came to give you the house keys.

01:13:07.183 --> 01:13:08.493
I'll be late.

01:13:08.753 --> 01:13:10.293
Mom will sleep
after taking her medicines.

01:13:10.583 --> 01:13:11.583
So, here's the key.

01:13:12.133 --> 01:13:13.523
Okay, you leave now.

01:13:13.603 --> 01:13:15.163
It'll be a problem
if anyone sees you.

01:13:19.293 --> 01:13:20.133
I'll leave.

01:13:27.713 --> 01:13:30.063
Don't worry.
I've checked everything.

01:13:34.063 --> 01:13:34.933
Tell me, Madhan.

01:13:35.323 --> 01:13:37.033
D-Did you forget?

01:13:37.253 --> 01:13:39.733
I have asked you about my job.

01:13:42.183 --> 01:13:43.063
Sorry, Madhan.

01:13:43.993 --> 01:13:45.433
There's a lot of work here.

01:13:46.633 --> 01:13:48.643
So I couldn't call you.
- That's okay...

01:13:49.543 --> 01:13:50.383
What happened?

01:13:50.493 --> 01:13:52.853
I'm trying
to solve the hospital problems.

01:13:54.083 --> 01:13:56.933
I have a lot to manage internally.

01:13:59.033 --> 01:14:00.243
After you asked me

01:14:00.833 --> 01:14:02.343
I gave it some thought.

01:14:02.593 --> 01:14:04.933
If you come back to the hospital
after everything that happened...

01:14:06.363 --> 01:14:07.743
I don't think it will work out.

01:14:08.233 --> 01:14:09.563
Even if I say okay

01:14:09.893 --> 01:14:12.363
I'm not sure
if the management will agree.

01:14:12.833 --> 01:14:16.893
But, I'll do whatever I can
to help you.

01:14:17.353 --> 01:14:19.563
I'll see if I can get you a job
in another management.

01:14:21.043 --> 01:14:22.523
I can help you in this way.

01:14:26.963 --> 01:14:29.733
I hope you understand.

01:14:30.633 --> 01:14:31.853
Yeah, I understand, Arjun.

01:14:32.093 --> 01:14:33.313
Thank you...

01:14:41.733 --> 01:14:43.683
Doctor!
Doctor!

01:14:44.093 --> 01:14:46.563
Doctor, please come soon.
- It hurts!

01:14:47.623 --> 01:14:49.393
It hurts a lot...
- What happened?

01:14:49.453 --> 01:14:51.913
She can't bear the pain in her leg.

01:14:51.943 --> 01:14:53.503
Please do something.

01:14:53.573 --> 01:14:55.573
Kiran, check her BP
and saturation level. - Okay.

01:14:55.633 --> 01:14:56.783
Get her the painkillers.

01:14:56.933 --> 01:14:58.953
Nurse, get the antibiotics ready.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:14:59.003 --> 01:15:00.393
One minute.
- Doctor?

01:15:00.423 --> 01:15:01.733
Call Dr. Preetham also.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:15:03.203 --> 01:15:06.123
Please do something, Doctor...

01:15:06.183 --> 01:15:07.033
Sir.

01:15:08.123 --> 01:15:09.703
A typical case of diabetic foot.

01:15:10.423 --> 01:15:12.533
A week ago, she suffered
a minor injury to her leg.

01:15:12.953 --> 01:15:14.743
They've bandaged it properly.

01:15:15.683 --> 01:15:17.663
But, the situation
got worse within a week.

01:15:18.673 --> 01:15:20.433
She couldn't bear the pain,
so they brought her here.

01:15:21.923 --> 01:15:23.443
Did any of her relatives come here?

01:15:23.583 --> 01:15:24.523
Yes, sir.

01:15:25.033 --> 01:15:26.963
I work with Narmada.

01:15:27.203 --> 01:15:28.783
We are teachers in a school.

01:15:28.913 --> 01:15:31.813
She doesn't have
any family or relatives.

01:15:32.363 --> 01:15:34.233
She has diabetes, right?

01:15:34.433 --> 01:15:36.983
Yes, sir.
She's taking tablets for that.

01:15:38.413 --> 01:15:39.353
So, Reena..

01:15:40.603 --> 01:15:41.853
I need a complete blood profile.

01:15:42.573 --> 01:15:43.713
Take the CBC count.

01:15:44.043 --> 01:15:45.993
Sure, sir.
- According to my calculations...

01:15:46.593 --> 01:15:48.103
The WBC count will be high.

01:15:48.453 --> 01:15:49.393
It should be high.

01:15:50.293 --> 01:15:51.123
In such case...

01:15:51.143 --> 01:15:53.063
We need to remove
the patient's toe.

01:15:55.023 --> 01:15:57.173
Send her samples to the lab.

01:15:57.243 --> 01:15:58.323
And Kamal..
- Sir?

01:15:58.483 --> 01:16:01.643
Go to the lab and wait
for the test and scan results.

01:16:01.763 --> 01:16:03.583
Tell them I asked for it.
- Okay, sir.

01:16:04.073 --> 01:16:05.663
Keep me updated.
- Okay, sir

01:16:05.693 --> 01:16:07.623
Don't worry. We'll take care of it.
- Okay, sir.

01:16:11.193 --> 01:16:12.103
I'll leave now.
- Okay.

01:16:15.443 --> 01:16:16.563
Go on.
- I'll do as he says.

01:16:17.073 --> 01:16:17.903
Kamal..

01:16:18.423 --> 01:16:20.643
Just a minute.
- Oh, my god! It's you!

01:16:22.643 --> 01:16:23.523
Sir!

01:16:30.643 --> 01:16:31.513
Ma'am!

01:16:33.513 --> 01:16:36.523
What happened to our teacher?
What are you doing to her now?

01:16:37.513 --> 01:16:40.643
Doctor, they are
Narmada's students.

01:16:40.983 --> 01:16:43.913
They have struggled a lot
in their life.

01:16:44.123 --> 01:16:49.853
Narmada is the one who brought
them up and educated them.

01:16:50.193 --> 01:16:54.203
That's why they are
very attached to Narmada.

01:16:55.873 --> 01:16:58.713
Narmada doesn't have anyone
but these children.

01:16:59.133 --> 01:17:02.833
These children don't have anyone
but Narmada.

01:17:03.183 --> 01:17:04.023
Ma'am...

01:17:05.493 --> 01:17:08.583
Our teacher is not well, right?
Will she die?

01:17:11.633 --> 01:17:12.473
Hey, dear...

01:17:13.003 --> 01:17:16.023
We'll do our best to save
your teacher, okay?

01:17:19.123 --> 01:17:20.953
Hey, he is just kidding.

01:17:29.793 --> 01:17:30.983
Nothing happened to your teacher.

01:17:31.203 --> 01:17:32.903
She'll be fine soon, okay?

01:17:40.383 --> 01:17:42.653
I heard she's your favourite
teacher. Is that true?

01:17:45.423 --> 01:17:48.593
Your teacher wants to go to school
soon and meet all of you.

01:17:48.903 --> 01:17:51.143
We've asked her
to rest here for a few days.

01:17:51.643 --> 01:17:52.933
She'll be fine soon, okay?

01:17:54.453 --> 01:17:55.283
Good girl.

01:17:57.453 --> 01:17:58.603
Take care.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:18:07.643 --> 01:18:10.413
Reena, why are you giving
false hope to the kids?

01:18:11.233 --> 01:18:12.843
Let them have this hope
for a few more days.

01:18:13.543 --> 01:18:16.433
Maybe, their hope can help Narmada.

01:18:17.173 --> 01:18:18.313
Like a miracle?

01:18:19.933 --> 01:18:21.023
You can say that.

01:18:31.253 --> 01:18:32.123
What is it?

01:18:32.543 --> 01:18:33.603
Did you see that?

01:18:33.943 --> 01:18:35.683
Even though Reena
appears to be cold and rude

01:18:36.073 --> 01:18:37.323
she is actually very soft-hearted.

01:18:37.823 --> 01:18:39.603
She has understood
the kids very well.

01:18:42.343 --> 01:18:44.043
Please don't blush.

01:18:44.463 --> 01:18:45.523
I can't stand it.

01:18:46.373 --> 01:18:47.853
Get lost.

01:18:49.333 --> 01:18:51.733
Idiot. You always talk about Reena.

01:18:51.753 --> 01:18:53.183
Go and find some work to do.

01:18:54.243 --> 01:18:55.203
Hey..

01:18:56.493 --> 01:18:57.413
Whatever.

01:18:59.253 --> 01:19:00.603
Keep this in the ER.
- Okay, ma'am.

01:19:01.593 --> 01:19:02.513
Hey, Kamal.
- Oh, no!

01:19:05.063 --> 01:19:07.233
I'm sorry
for what happened in the canteen.

01:19:09.053 --> 01:19:10.843
Did they upset you?

01:19:11.283 --> 01:19:13.233
Yes. Work pressure.

01:19:14.803 --> 01:19:15.853
It's okay.

01:19:16.483 --> 01:19:18.463
But you were very rude.

01:19:18.853 --> 01:19:20.893
Your tone was very scary.

01:19:21.443 --> 01:19:23.733
I even got confused
whether it was you.

01:19:24.233 --> 01:19:25.073
I'm sorry.

01:19:26.523 --> 01:19:27.393
It's okay.

01:19:27.893 --> 01:19:30.653
At least you took your anger
out on me. I'm glad.

01:19:31.593 --> 01:19:35.733
Amaya, if you had told me earlier
there's a scarier side to you

01:19:36.243 --> 01:19:37.593
I would have been more careful.

01:19:37.933 --> 01:19:40.683
You are very scary.

01:19:41.613 --> 01:19:45.123
Okay, don't mind me. Bye.

01:19:55.243 --> 01:19:56.393
Is everything okay?

01:19:57.713 --> 01:20:00.223
Sir, does it hurt here?
- Yes, ma'am, it hurts.

01:20:00.743 --> 01:20:02.833
Does it hurt anywhere else?
- Only my head.

01:20:03.243 --> 01:20:05.333
Any breathing issues?
- No, nothing as of now.

01:20:05.523 --> 01:20:06.643
You are okay now, right?

01:20:08.693 --> 01:20:09.603
I took the reports.

01:20:12.783 --> 01:20:14.433
Okay. Take rest. We will come.

01:20:15.643 --> 01:20:16.603
Take care.

01:20:19.513 --> 01:20:20.563
Teju, take this.

01:20:21.523 --> 01:20:23.773
Ma'am, we checked
the CT scan results thoroughly.

01:20:24.173 --> 01:20:26.493
This looks like pneumonia.

01:20:27.133 --> 01:20:28.723
But it is not like
the usual pneumonia.

01:20:29.103 --> 01:20:30.523
Okay.
- Look at this.

01:20:31.473 --> 01:20:33.313
There is some
pleural effusion here.

01:20:34.343 --> 01:20:35.563
This is not very common.

01:20:35.823 --> 01:20:38.143
It looks like an allergic reaction.
- Okay.

01:20:38.223 --> 01:20:42.853
According to the patient's insights,
he doesn't have any allergies.

01:20:43.733 --> 01:20:44.643
Ma'am?
- Okay.

01:20:44.733 --> 01:20:47.383
I think it is safe for the patient
if we find out the cause

01:20:47.453 --> 01:20:49.013
before starting treatment.

01:20:49.283 --> 01:20:51.033
I will keep you
in the broad spectrum till then.

01:20:51.433 --> 01:20:52.683
It's a better option, I guess.

01:20:53.113 --> 01:20:56.083
But we can't take too much time
either. That is also not safe.

01:20:56.973 --> 01:20:57.843
Do one thing.

01:20:58.423 --> 01:21:01.623
Obtain the patient's consent
to go to his house and search.

01:21:02.013 --> 01:21:05.033
If you find
any allergy-triggering object

01:21:05.663 --> 01:21:06.423
bring it here.

01:21:06.743 --> 01:21:08.823
Okay, ma'am.
- Yeah. Okay.

01:21:09.133 --> 01:21:09.973
Okay.

01:21:10.203 --> 01:21:11.023
Thank you, ma'am...

01:21:17.853 --> 01:21:19.643
Teju, how are we going?

01:21:25.983 --> 01:21:27.223
What do you mean?
- I mean...

01:21:27.443 --> 01:21:29.873
Are we taking your bike or mine?

01:21:30.043 --> 01:21:31.313
Who said we are going together?

01:21:31.963 --> 01:21:33.933
You take your bike
and I'll take mine.

01:21:34.073 --> 01:21:36.533
But we are going
to the same place, right?

01:21:36.653 --> 01:21:39.433
Why do we have to waste fuel
by taking two vehicles? That's why.

01:21:39.643 --> 01:21:41.223
Relieve from this case
if it is so difficult.

01:21:41.513 --> 01:21:42.813
At least I will be at peace.

01:21:43.513 --> 01:21:45.023
I can't give up so easily, Teju.

01:21:46.813 --> 01:21:48.423
I-I meant the case.

01:22:10.133 --> 01:22:11.003
Who is it?

01:22:14.103 --> 01:22:14.923
Hi!

01:22:36.693 --> 01:22:38.643
Hi! Welcome! How are you?

01:22:39.183 --> 01:22:40.163
I am fine, Suchi.

01:22:43.163 --> 01:22:44.353
There is some problem.

01:22:44.683 --> 01:22:47.323
I came to ask you about it but
you're giving me the cold shoulder.

01:22:48.443 --> 01:22:50.623
Don't you want to share
anything with me?

01:22:52.503 --> 01:22:53.473
What are you doing here?

01:22:58.533 --> 01:22:59.563
What am I doing here?

01:22:59.783 --> 01:23:04.723
Why did I even bother to check up
on you as your sister?

01:23:12.923 --> 01:23:14.603
'I am not here to argue with you.'

01:23:14.763 --> 01:23:16.293
'Arjun asked me to consult you.'

01:23:16.683 --> 01:23:17.573
'Reena!'

01:23:18.463 --> 01:23:19.853
'Don't raise your voice.'

01:23:19.913 --> 01:23:21.743
'I am the chief doctor
in this hospital.'

01:23:22.023 --> 01:23:24.163
'I will decide who should do what.'

01:23:24.353 --> 01:23:25.193
'Not Radhi.'

01:23:26.073 --> 01:23:27.083
'Hey, Amaya!'

01:23:27.273 --> 01:23:28.653
'Amaya! Amaya!'

